          %h4#TwistedTadpoleCancellation Local/twisted tadpole cancellation
          %p
            The
            %strong twisted (local) tadpole cancellation condition
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fractional+D-branes"} fractional D-branes
            at orbifold singularities is that the RR-charges in all non-trivially twisted sectors vanish:
          #eq:VanishingOfCharacterValuesOnNontrivialSubgroups.maruku-equation
            %span.maruku-eq-number (2)
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
